      en: ["Plateau elevation: approximately 500 meters", "Area: about 300 square kilometers", "Dragon's blood tree: Dracaena cinnabari", "Resin: dragon's blood, used for centuries", "Threatened by overgrazing and climate change", "Endemic bird: Socotra sparrow"],
